        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Professional repair services are available and transparent; detailed repair guidance covers common damaged elements; company repair service is available throughout the sales region.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability"/>
